 ## Unreleased — 1.4.0
 
-Nothing yet.
+### The usage ledger moved to the home directory
+
+`.smysl/usage.log` used to live beside whichever project `smysl` happened to run from, so
+cost accounting reset every time the working directory changed. It now lives under
+`$HOME/.smysl/usage.log` (`$USERPROFILE` on Windows; `$SMYSL_HOME` overrides both, for a
+caller that wants isolation), so `smysl usage` reports what one person has spent across every
+project rather than one project's slice of it. Falls back to the old project-relative
+location when no home directory resolves, so the ledger stays informational rather than
+becoming a new way for a command to fail.
 
 ---
 
